# RAG poisoning: indirect prompt injection embedded in RETRIEVED content.
# Every case is input_source=retrieved_document -- content an agent pulled from a
# knowledge base, not something the user typed. Mix of overt and subtle payloads;
# the subtle ones are where source-aware posture (a lowered threshold for
# untrusted origins) is meant to help.
